 |---|---|
 | `@artyfact/rules` | The Datalog engine, imported from `packages/rules` (the bropilot copy was that package moved verbatim and is deleted here). |
 | `src/codec/` | The Genome v2 tree codec: `parseTree` and `readTree` (node tree -> `Graph`, template nodes from the meta@1 sources), `applyOps` (ops -> file changes through the `yaml` Document API), `mintId`, `formatNodeFile`. `@artyfact/ontology/codec/v1` is `convertV1`, the one-time v1 -> v2 converter behind `artyfact convert-genome`; its Keep in Touch output is `examples/keep-in-touch-system`, converted from the v1 copy in `test/fixtures/artyfact/keep-in-touch-system` (regenerate with `UPDATE_GENOME_FIXTURE=1`). |
 | `src/genome/` | Genome v2 contract: `node.yaml` schema (`NodeFileSchema`, inline criteria and hooks), the legacy v1 check, directory slugs, and template view hints (`KindViewSchema`, `TemplateViewSchema`, `resolveKindView`, `checkViewHints`). |
